<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Sunday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) beat 6-Amanda Coetzer (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) beat 5-Lindsay Davenport</p>
<p>(U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (France) beat Virginia Ruano Pascual (Spain) 6-0</p>
<p>2-6 6-3</p>
<p>Magdalena Grzybowska (Poland) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Kerry-Anne Guse (Australia) 6-0</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) beat Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>11-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Aleksandra Olsza (Poland) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Lorna Woodroffe (Britain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia) beat Nicole Pratt (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
</text>
